<title>CANADA: Canada Feb department store sales rise on month.</title>
<headline>Canada Feb department store sales rise on month.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian department stores sales rose a seasonally adjusted 2.0 percent in February from January to C$1.28 billion, Statistics Canada said on Thursday.</p>
<p>In unadjusted data, year-over-year sales in February rose 5.2 percent to C$846.5 million.</p>
<p>(For more information from Statistics Canada, contact Sylvain Tremblay, Retail Trade Section, Industry Division, 613-951-4166.)</p>
<p>((Reuters Ottawa Bureau, 613-235-6745))</p>
</text>
